# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
# lab6-paradigma (repositorio principal Lab 8)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
# El workspace oficial vive en:
#   my-team-workspace/my-team-workspace/
# Se versionan brain/, Knowledge/, Skills/, AGENTS.md, reglas y docs.
# Los clones bajo Repos/ conservan su propio Git y no se incorporan aquí.

# ── Repos clonados (conservar solo el índice de instrucciones) ──
/my-team-workspace/my-team-workspace/Repos/*
!/my-team-workspace/my-team-workspace/Repos/AGENTS.md

# ── Carpetas locales del workspace (si existen) ──
/my-team-workspace/my-team-workspace/Machine/
/my-team-workspace/my-team-workspace/temp/

# ── Historial Git del workspace anidado (renombrado, no borrado) ──
# Ver README/brain Gaps: evita embeber un submódulo accidental.
/my-team-workspace/my-team-workspace/.git.backup-lab8-workspace/

# ── Estado de editor Obsidian (las notas en brain/ sí se versionan) ──
**/brain/.obsidian/workspace.json
**/brain/.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
**/brain/.obsidian/cache/

# ── Secretos y artefactos generados ──
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
.vercel/
test-results/
playwright-report/
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
